    "Photos illustrate a food category; they do not authenticate meal identity or calculate nutrients.",
    "Unknown foods use a neutral placeholder until the user chooses a photo.",
    "User-selected photos override automatic keyword matching.",
    "A saved food's macros come from the user's saved record, not this manifest.",
    "Avoid recognizable people, trademarks, branded packaging and misleading product association."
